{
  "description": "Caligo: seas of dense brine under a thick purple-teal haze. Salt-crusted lowlands, brackish fens, rust-red highlands and violet mountain ranges, with slush at the poles. Landings are easy, ascents are not.",
  "seed": 6100,
  "minHeight": -4200,
  "maxHeight": 7600,
